        },
        {
          "text": " “You shall not sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God an ox or a sheep in which is a blemish, any defect whatever; for that is an abomination to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
